Fuse Vulkan DIR finishing and XYZ/CAM16 while retaining the separated paths.

Selective adaptation of the Metal implementations in JamesQiu2005/SpektraLab
main d4b8145f6f9bdade15cda014776e99521adf0b5f. Keep Android dispatch chunking,
buffer lifetimes, matrix storage conventions and existing CAM16 expressions.
Only SPK_VULKAN_FUSION=on enables both experimental fusions. Unset, off and
unknown values retain the unchanged reference path. Mobile default remains
off pending real-device validation; this diagnostic environment switch is
not an Android user recovery control.
Test-only group-X reduction exercises chunk boundaries without exceeding
advertised buffer limits. Production dispatch limits remain unchanged.
Co-created with GPT (OpenAI), 2026-11-09.
